# There is a dog in the status line. It answers to a name.
Output demo/gif/dog.gif
Source demo/tapes/_common.tape

Type "$JACK notes.md" Enter
Sleep 1800ms

Type ":set dog" Enter Sleep 1500ms
Space Type "p" Sleep 2000ms
Type ":dog speak" Enter Sleep 2000ms
Type ":dog sit" Enter Sleep 1800ms
Type ":dog fetch" Enter Sleep 2500ms
Type ":dog run" Enter Sleep 2500ms
Type ":dog good" Enter Sleep 2000ms
Type ":dog" Enter Sleep 2500ms

# What the session came to.
Type ":stats" Enter Sleep 3000ms
